        "ingredient/star-anise", "ingredient/cinnamon", "ingredient/spring-onion", "ingredient/water"
      ],
      "text": "Pour in the {wine} and let it sizzle, then add the {soy}, the {dark-soy}, the {ginger}, the {star-anise}[cinnamon: , the {cinnamon}] and the {spring-onion:plural}. Add enough hot {water} to just cover the {pork}, bring it to a boil, then cover and simmer very gently until the fat is soft and wobbly and the lean is tender. Check a cube against a trusted guide to doneness.",
      "time": {"from": 60, "to": 90, "unit": "minute"},
      "temperature": null,
      "safety_points": ["doneness"],
