      "works_on": ["preparation/braising-liquid"],
      "with": ["ingredient/pork-belly"],
      "text": "Take off the lid and lift out the {ginger}, the {spring-onion:plural} and the whole spices. Turn up the heat and boil, turning the {pork} often, until the sauce is thick, dark and sticky and coats each cube.",
      "time": {"from": 10, "to": 15, "unit": "minute"},
